<para>
  <command>Color</command> is the one property that has no physical
  significance in &oof2;. It merely provides a color for displaying a
  &material; in the <link linkend="Chapter-Graphics">Graphics
  window</link>.  The <link
  linkend="RegisteredClass-DisplayMethod"><classname>DisplayMethods</classname></link>
  that use the <command>Color</command> &property; are <xref
  linkend="RegisteredClass-MicrostructureMaterialDisplay"/>, <xref
  linkend="RegisteredClass-SkeletonMaterialDisplay"/>, and <xref
  linkend="RegisteredClass-MeshMaterialDisplay"/>.
</para>

